A kagamimochi is formed by placing mochi $A$ on top of mochi $B$ if $A \le B/2$.
We need to select $2K$ mochi from the range $[L, R]$ and form $K$ pairs $(A, B)$ such that for each pair, the condition holds. We want to maximize $K$.

